[[Aether-Rich Sap]] is a [[currency]] obtained by completing [[events]] throughout [[Shipwreck Strand]]. They can be spent at various vendors across Castora. {{item icon|Chromatic Sap}} and {{item icon|Aether-Rich Sap}} and can be converted at a 1:5 ratio with no limit:
* Consuming 1 Chromatic Sap awards 5 Aether-Rich Sap.
* 5 Aether-Rich Sap can be used to purchase 1 Chromatic Sap at any Castoran renown vendor.

